sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Bedrock as Bedrock Converse
  participant Lambda as Lambda tool
  App->>Bedrock: messages + toolConfig
  Bedrock->>App: stopReason tool_use<br/>(toolUse block)
  App->>Lambda: run tool with input
  Lambda->>App: tool result
  App->>Bedrock: messages + toolResult
  Bedrock->>App: final answer
